{"id":"en_he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire","title":"He Cheated in French. I Took Back His Empire","titleEn":"He Cheated in French. I Took Back His Empire","description":"On the night of their sixth wedding anniversary, Ava's husband Ryan introduces Lily into their home—a French exchange student whose studies Ava has funded for five years. Right in front of Ava, the pair carry on flirting in French, a language she does not understand. The betrayal unfolds in her own house, on a day meant to celebrate their marriage, with the very person Ava had supported for so long at the center of it. The story follows what happens when Ava decides to reclaim what is hers. Viewers can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds7e2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds7e2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds7e2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds7e2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-cheated-in-french-i-took-back-his-empire_4